WEBVTT

NOTE
Cruise missiles dive on the mobile Balamb Garden.
Duration: approximately 25 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
A lone missile streaks across the sky.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.350
Top-down, winged cruise missiles plunge toward Balamb Garden's ring.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:22.270
They burst in orange against the hull as the Garden is swarmed.
